{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"岗位与职业路径","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"Pfizer 技术岗位职业路径完全指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths/engineering","wordCount":3085,"readingTime":13},{"seq":2,"slug":"research-scientist","title":"研究科学家职业路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths/research-scientist","wordCount":1566,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"clinical-medical","title":"临床医学职业路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths/clinical-medical","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"manufacturing-supply","title":"制造与供应链职业路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths/manufacturing-supply","wordCount":1623,"readingTime":7},{"seq":5,"slug":"commercial-market","title":"商务与市场职业路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/role-career-paths/commercial-market","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"岗位与职业路径-简介\">岗位与职业路径 简介</h1><p>本章为辉瑞各职能方向提供完整的职业路径指南——从入门到高级领导层的晋升阶梯、薪酬参考、能力要求和实战策略。</p>\n<p><strong>技术岗位路径</strong>是本章旗舰文档，深度解析数字化/AI药物研发/数据科学/软件工程/自动化五大技术方向，含逐级晋升行动清单和IC vs管理框架选择指南。</p>\n<p><strong>研究科学家路径</strong>覆盖药物发现、临床前研究、生物学和化学四大科学方向，解析辉瑞独有的Scientific Track晋升机制。</p>\n<p><strong>临床医学路径</strong>涵盖临床运营、医学事务和药物警戒三大方向，适合MD/PharmD/PhD背景的专业人员。</p>\n<p><strong>制造供应链路径</strong>解析GMP生产、工艺开发、质量管理和全球供应网络的职业阶梯。</p>\n<p><strong>商务市场路径</strong>覆盖市场准入、销售、数字营销和品牌管理，特别关注IRA时代的准入策略变革。</p>\n"}